 "sellerTermsShipping": "<p>\n  <font style=\"font-size: 20.0px;\">\n    <font color=\"#800000\">\n      <u>\n        <strong>Deutschland</strong>\n      </u>\n    </font>\n  </font>\n</p>\n<p>\n  <u>\n    <strong>Allgemein</strong>\n  </u>\n</p>\n<p>Wir versenden grundsätzlich an die bei Bricklink (bzw. bei PayPal)\n  hinterlegte Adresse. Sollten Sie den Versand an eine andere Adresse\n  wünschen, so kontaktieren Sie uns bitte frühzeitig.</p>\n<p>\n  <strong>WICHTIG: Warten Sie vor der Bezahlung auf jeden Fall auf\n    unsere Bestätigung Ihrer geänderten Adresse.</strong>\n</p>\n<p>\n  <u>\n    <strong>Versandkosten Deutschland</strong>\n  </u>\n</p>\n<p>Versandkosten (beinhaltet Verpackung, Aufwand und Frachtkosten)\n  innerhalb Deutschlands:</p>\n<p>DHL Paket: 6,90€ (inkl. MwSt.) pro angefangenes 30kg Paket (max.\n  Warenkorbgewicht 26kg)</p>\n<p>Unter 1000€ Warenwert ist die Versicherung bereits enthalten.</p>\n<p>Zzgl. 6€ (inkl. MwSt) je\n  angefangene <strong>zusätzliche </strong>1000€ Warenwert.</p>\n<p> </p>\n<p>\n  <font style=\"font-size: 18.0px;\">\n    <font color=\"#ff0000\">\n      <strong>\n        <u>Bearbeitungsgebühren</u>\n      </strong>\n    </font>\n  </font>\n</p>\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">\n  <span>Für Bestellungen mit einem durchschnittlichen Lot-Wert unter\n    1,00 € pro Lot berechnen wir eine  Bearbeitungsgebühr. Die Höhe der\n    Gebühr richtet sich nach dem durchschnittlichen Lot-Wert der Bestellung:</span>\n</p>\n<ul>\n  <li>\n    <font color=\"#FF0000\">\n      <span>Über 1,00 € pro Lot: keine Bearbeitungsgebühr</span>\n    </font>\n  </li>\n  <li>\n    <span>Unter 1,00 € pro Lot: 0,30 € pro Lot</span>\n  </li>\n</ul>\n<p> </p>\n<p>\n  <font style=\"font-size: 20.0px;\">\n    <font color=\"#800000\">\n      <u>\n        <strong>EU countries</strong>\n      </u>\n    </font>\n  </font>\n</p>\n<p>\n  <strong>General</strong>\n</p>\n<p>We generally ship to the adress entered on PayPal.com (or BrickLink\n  in case of bank transfer). If you wish your order to be sent to\n  another address, feel free to contact us.</p>\n<p>\n  <strong>IMPORTANT: Please wait for our confirmation of any address\n    changes before paying your order.</strong>\n</p>\n<p>(You may have to turn on the shopping cart weight option in My\n  Settings to see the weight of your items)</p>\n<p>\n  <strong>All orders will be shipped with tracking and insurance</strong>\n</p>\n<p> </p>\n<p>\n  <font color=\"#ff0000\">\n    <strong>\n      <u>\n        <font style=\"font-size: 16.0px;\">Handling Fees</font>\n      </u>\n    </strong>\n  </font>\n</p>\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">\n  <span>Orders with an average lot value below €1.00 per lot are subject\n    to a handling fee. The fee is calculated based on the average lot\n    value of the order:</span>\n</p>\n<ul>\n  <li>\n    <font color=\"#FF0000\">\n      <span>Above €1.00 per lot: No handling fee</span>\n    </font>\n  </li>\n  <li>\n    <span>Below €1.00 per lot: €0.30 per lot</span>\n  </li>\n</ul>\n<p> </p>\n<p>\n  <font color=\"#006633\">\n    <strong>\n      <u>\n        <font style=\"font-size: 16.0px;\">DHL</font>\n      </u>\n    </strong>\n  </font>\n</p>\n<p>10.90 EUR (incl. VAT) up to 750g of shopping cart weight and value\n  under 50 EUR</p>\n<ul>\n  <li>Max Dimension: 30cm x 20cm x 7cm</li>\n</ul>\n<p>19.90 EUR (incl. VAT) up to 4000g of shopping cart weight </p>\n<p>23.80 EUR (incl. VAT) up to 26kg of shopping cart weight (even higher\n  weight orders will receive multiple parcels)</p>\n<p>+12 EUR for insurance above 999,99 EUR per 1000 EUR value</p>\n<p> </p>\n<p>\n  <font color=\"#006633\">\n    <strong>\n      <u>\n        <font style=\"font-size: 16.0px;\">DHL Express</font>\n      </u>\n    </strong>\n  </font>\n</p>\n<p>34.90 EUR (incl. VAT) up to 4000g of shopping cart weight </p>\n<p>49.90 EUR (incl. VAT) up to 8000g of shopping cart weight </p>\n<p>74.90 EUR (incl. VAT) up to 16000g of shopping cart weight </p>\n<p>84.90 EUR (incl. VAT) up to 26kg of shopping cart weight (even higher\n  weight orders will receive multiple parcels)</p>\n<p>+12 EUR for insurance above 999,99 EUR per 1000 EUR value</p>\n<p> </p>\n<p>\n  <font style=\"font-size: 20.0px;\">\n    <font color=\"#800000\">\n      <u>\n        <strong>UK + EFTA countries</strong>\n      </u>\n    </font>\n  </font>\n</p>\n<p>\n  <strong>General</strong>\n</p>\n<p>We generally ship to the adress entered on PayPal.com (or BrickLink\n  in case of bank transfer). If you wish your order to be sent to\n  another address, feel free to contact us.</p>\n<p>\n  <strong>IMPORTANT: Please wait for our confirmation of any address\n    changes before paying your order.</strong>\n</p>\n<p>(You may have to turn on the shopping cart weight option in My\n  Settings to see the weight of your items)</p>\n<p>\n  <strong>All orders will be shipped with tracking and insurance</strong>\n</p>\n<p> </p>\n<p>\n  <font color=\"#ff0000\">\n    <strong>\n      <u>\n        <font style=\"font-size: 16.0px;\">Handling Fees</font>\n      </u>\n    </strong>\n  </font>\n</p>\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">Orders with an average lot value below €1.00\n  per lot are subject to a handling fee. The fee is calculated based on\n  the average lot value of the order:</p>\n<ul>\n  <li>\n    <font color=\"#FF0000\">Above €1.00 per lot: No handling fee</font>\n  </li>\n  <li>Below €1.00 per lot: €0.30 per lot</li>\n</ul>\n<p> </p>\n<p>\n  <font color=\"#006633\">\n    <strong>\n      <u>\n        <font style=\"font-size: 16.0px;\">DHL</font>\n      </u>\n    </strong>\n  </font>\n</p>\n<p>12.90 EUR up to 750g of shopping cart weight and value under 50 EUR</p>\n<ul>\n  <li>Max Dimension: 30cm x 20cm x 7cm</li>\n</ul>\n<p>22.90 EUR up to 4000g of shopping cart weight </p>\n<p>29.90 EUR up to 26kg of shopping cart weight (even higher weight\n  orders will receive multiple parcels)</p>\n<p>+12 EUR for insurance above 999,99 EUR per 1000 EUR value</p>\n<p> </p>\n<p>\n  <font color=\"#006633\">\n    <strong>\n      <u>\n        <font style=\"font-size: 16.0px;\">DHL Express</font>\n      </u>\n    </strong>\n  </font>\n</p>\n<p>44.90 EUR (incl. VAT) up to 4000g of shopping cart weight </p>\n<p>59.90 EUR (incl. VAT) up to 8000g of shopping cart weight </p>\n<p>79.90 EUR (incl. VAT) up to 16000g of shopping cart weight </p>\n<p>109.90 EUR (incl. VAT) up to 26kg of shopping cart weight (even\n  higher weight orders will receive multiple parcels)</p>\n<p>+12 EUR for insurance above 999,99 EUR per 1000 EUR value</p>\n<p> </p>\n<p>\n  <font style=\"font-size: 20.0px;\">\n    <font color=\"#800000\">\n      <u>\n        <strong>World Wide</strong>\n      </u>\n    </font>\n  </font>\n</p>\n<p>\n  <strong>General</strong>\n</p>\n<p>We generally ship to the adress entered on PayPal.com (or BrickLink\n  in case of bank transfer). If you wish your order to be sent to\n  another address, feel free to contact us.</p>\n<p>\n  <strong>IMPORTANT: Please wait for our confirmation of any address\n    changes before paying your order.</strong>\n</p>\n<p>(You may have to turn on the shopping cart weight option in My\n  Settings to see the weight of your items)</p>\n<p>\n  <strong>All orders will be shipped with tracking and insurance</strong>\n</p>\n<p> </p>\n<p>\n  <font color=\"#ff0000\">\n    <strong>\n      <u>\n        <font style=\"font-size: 16.0px;\">Handling Fees</font>\n      </u>\n    </strong>\n  </font>\n</p>\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">Orders with an average lot value below €1.00\n  per lot are subject to a handling fee. The fee is calculated based on\n  the average lot value of the order:</p>\n<ul>\n  <li>\n    <font color=\"#FF0000\">Above €1.00 per lot: No handling fee</font>\n  </li>\n  <li>Below €1.00 per lot: €0.30 per lot</li>\n</ul>\n<p> </p>\n<p>\n  <font color=\"#006633\">\n    <strong>\n      <u>\n        <font style=\"font-size: 16.0px;\">DHL</font>\n      </u>\n    </strong>\n  </font>\n</p>\n<p>\n  <font color=\"#006633\">\n    <strong>\n      <u>\n        <font st